                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>To support the national strategy for the integrated development of education, technology, and talent, this course restructures and integrates the traditional Advanced Histology & Embryology curriculum. It combines the development, structure, and function of human tissues and organs with clinical diseases, leveraging MOOCs, AI-powered teaching assistants, and mind maps to create a comprehensive, interconnected three-dimensional medical knowledge system. This system logically links fundamental medical science with clinical medicine and public health, fostering the knowledge and capability development of innovative and elite talents in the new medical field.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
